OL,3,CTeen dies in 'terrible accident'
OL,4,Cduring family holiday in the Dominican
OL,5,CRepublic
OL,7,FTributes have been paid to a
OL,8,F'beautiful' 16-year-old who died in a
OL,9,F'terrible accident' while on holiday
OL,10,Fwith her family in the Dominican
OL,11,FRepublic.
OL,13,FAbbie Lainton, from Swindon,
OL,14,FWiltshire, died on July 30 in an
OL,15,Fincident that also left two of her
OL,16,Fsiblings 'badly injured'.
OL,18,FThe teenager was a cheerleader and a
OL,19,Fcoach with the Swindon Lightning
OL,20,FCheerleading Club who said Abbie
OL,21,F'touched the lives of so many'.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
