FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786522689
OL,3,CTeen dies in 'terrible accident'
OL,4,Cduring family holiday in the Dominican
OL,5,CRepublic
OL,7,FIn a tribute the club said: "It is
OL,8,Fwith the deepest sadness that we share
OL,9,Fthe heartbreaking news of the passing
OL,10,Fof our beautiful athlete and coach,
OL,11,FAbbie.
OL,13,F"There are simply no words that feel
OL,14,Fenough .Abbie was a much-loved member
OL,15,Fof our Swindon Lightning family.
OL,17,F"Her kindness, infectious smile,
OL,18,Funwavering encouragement and love for
OL,19,Fcheerleading touched the lives of so
OL,20,Fmany athletes, coaches and families
OL,21,Fover the years.
OL,26,@oD@]OUuD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
