SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786522689
OL,3,CTeen dies in 'terrible accident'
OL,4,Cduring family holiday in the Dominican
OL,5,CRepublic
OL,7,F"She brought so much light to our gym,
OL,8,Fand her loss has left us all
OL,9,Fheartbroken. Our thoughts, love and
OL,10,Fdeepest condolences are with Abbie's
OL,11,Ffamily and loved ones during this
OL,12,Funimaginable time."
OL,14,FThe Tanwood School for Performing Arts
OL,15,Fadded: "Abbie joined Tanwood as a
OL,16,Fdinky dot and was part of an
OL,17,Fexceptional group of dancers who
OL,18,Fformed strong friendships which
OL,19,Fspilled over to the audience when they
OL,20,Fperformed together.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@SO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
