PN,40804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786522689
OL,3,CTeen dies in 'terrible accident'
OL,4,Cduring family holiday in the Dominican
OL,5,CRepublic
OL,7,F"She always performed with a huge
OL,8,Fsmile, and those beautiful feet!
OL,10,F"We are all in complete shock at this
OL,11,Fheartbreaking news and send so much
OL,12,Flove and support to her family and
OL,13,Ffriends at this unimaginable time. You
OL,14,Fwill always be in our hearts."
OL,16,FThe circumstances surrounding Abbie's
OL,17,Fdeath remain unclear.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
