CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786522689
OL,3,CTeen dies in 'terrible accident'
OL,4,Cduring family holiday in the Dominican
OL,5,CRepublic
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the Foreign
OL,8,FCommonwealth and Development Office
OL,9,Fsaid: "Our thoughts are with the
OL,10,FLainton family during this difficult
OL,11,Ftime.
OL,13,F"We are providing consular support to
OL,14,Fthe family and assisting other British
OL,15,Fnationals and their families affected
OL,16,Fby the incident. We are in contact
OL,17,Fwith the local authorities."
